// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1170261375" "Everyone's gotta have goals. Black Scorpion wants to build the nastiest power armor in existence. Recluse wants to rule Paragon City. Me? I'm the perfect combination of man and shark, with the killer instincts of both. I don't know what freak of evolution caused me to exist, and I don't really care. I just want to become the best at what I do - to become the perfect killing machine!<br><br>Some of my troops discovered something interesting during the torture of some Circle of Thorns, something about The Great Beast which lies beneath Sharkhead. I want to know more about this creature. My operatives have tracked some of the Leviathan-seeking Circle mages to one of the Thorn holes underneath Potter's Field on Sharkhead. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head to the caves and interrogate their leaders about the Leviathan!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3420268169" "Interrogate Circle leaders"
// SendOffString :
"P2909321122" "I want to know what this primal essence does. I don't care if you have to beat the Circle leaders bloody - just find out!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P807658596" "I want to know what this primal essence does! GET GOING!"

