// Dialog :
"P3394253720" "So the Circle wants to draw this primal essence from the Leviathan, eh? Well, they may not be willing to spill their secrets, but I know someone who might."
// RandomFameString :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1763517871" "So the Circle of Thorns know of this 'Leviathan' which sleeps beneath Sharkhead. I think they know more than they're letting on, and I bet it's 'cause it's something they want to keep for themselves! Filthy mages!<br><br>I know just the guy to tell us more about the Circle's plans with the Leviathan. He's an old sorcerer who goes by the named of Tarixus, and he knows more about the mystic stuff which goes on in the Rogue Isles than most. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to speak with Tarixus about the Circle's involvement with the Leviathan!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2747505467" "Speak with Tarixus about the Leviathan"
// SendOffString :
"P290525297" "Tarixus has an understanding with Arachnos. It's the only reason why he continues to exist."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2334751297" "Don't make me disembowel you! Find out what Tarixus knows about the Leviathan!"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P930063210" "<shout>You dare attack our temple? Die now, {VillainName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1758845930" "Ah, you wish to know about the Leviathan, do you? It is an ancient and powerful entity, trapped millennia ago beneath this island. Those who seek its power play a dangerous game, as these primal energies can just as easily destroy the wielder as it could grant them power. The Circle of Thorns of course desire the primal essence for themselves, as they believe they can harness it for use by their demon masters. There is a Death Mage named Raxtos lurking beneath Thorn Isle - he is mad enough to pursue such a power, and may have the answers you seek.<br><br>So Mako seeks this power for himself? And you plan to assist him in this endeavor? I will leave you with this warning: do not trust the shark-man, {VillainName}! Beings like him do not share power, and any possible rivals are more likely to be destroyed than be allowed to live!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2230018652" "An ancient and primal destructive power, eh? Sounds like my kind of party! I think we need to look into what we need to do to unlock this primal essence..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1986639229" "Archmage Tarixus mentioned something about the Circle mage Raxtos knowing how to tap into the power of the Leviathan. I want to know how! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head to the Circle of Thorns temple underneath Thorn Isle and interrogate Raxtos about the Leviathan!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P918930551" "Find information on the Leviathan"
// SendOffString :
"P3280953476" "If there's power to be had from the Leviathan, I want it."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1383155178" "You're making me angry. Don't make me angry. You wouldn't want to see me when I'm angry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4119719725" "The smell of musty corridors, burning torches, and ritual incense greets you. Find and interrogate Raxtos!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P270983949" "Succubus"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2113025371" "<shout>I come to you, my master!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P378922282" "Raxtos"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3998295208" "<shout>Ready yourselves! Our enemies seek our ultimate destruction!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2910169971" "<shout>It is you who will die, {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P412488812" "<shout>From the depths I summon you, my minions! Aid me against my foes!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1856341871" "<shout>You're too late, {VillainName}! Ghost Widow's operatives already came to collect what you seek! The Ritual of Z'kron has already been taken!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P4159652749" "<em=biglaugh>Another sacrifice!"

