// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1519753062" "WHAT? Is the Circle trying to set me against Ghost Widow? Or is that albino witch trying to mess with me?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2449827772" "We're close to finding out how to tap the power of the Leviathan! We'd have it by now if it wasn't for Ghost Widow! It's just like her to get in the way of my plans. Well, let's not get mad about this - let's get even! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Break into Ghost Widow's vaults at her tower on Mercy Island and steal back the Ritual of Z'kron!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4201571185" "Steal Ritual of Z'kron"
// SendOffString :
"P31284047" "This might get us into a bit of problem with the Arbiters, but don't worry - I'll take care of that!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2725077041" "Don't. Make. Me. Wait. Get me that damn Ritual!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1001998987" "Ghost Widow's operatives find mystical items within Fort Cerberus. Find the Ritual of Z'kron!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - StealRitual 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2252294519" "Safe"
// Description :
"P3703650107" "Find Ritual of Z'kron"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2722022965" "You begin opening the safe"
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P826846204" "You have been interrupted"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3869552369" "You finish opening the safe"
// InteractActionString :
"P1143515829" "Opening..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2974894735" "You found something"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Safe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P664098290" "You found some occult components, but no ritual"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2987873692" "You stole the Ritual of Z'kron!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2156796079" "This is the ritual, eh? Looks like I'll have to get one of the Mu Mystics to decipher it for me.<br><br>We're getting close now, {VillainName}. Soon, we'll move in for the kill!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2122364007" "I got a Mu Mystic workin' on deciphering the Ritual of Z'kron you stole from Ghost Widow's vaults. With any luck, we're gonna be able to work the ritual soon!<br><br>But we got some problems, too. Y'see, Ghost Widow got all bent out of shape about you breakin' into her place, and she demanded justice from the Arbiters! But don't worry, {VillainName}. I sent Arbiter Daos a big fat bribe, so I think that ought to be enough to get you off the hook! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Now go and talk with Arbiter Daos.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P160697474" "Speak with Arbiter Daos"
// SendOffString :
"P1820522630" "Arbiter Daos will probably just let you off with a warning or something. And if not, you're willing to take one for team Mako, aren't ya? Hehe."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1662650307" "I'd head over and talk with Arbiter Daos sooner than later. He don't like to be kept waitin'."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2743041621" "{VillainName}. I'm glad you decided to show up voluntarily, rather than having Arachnos send out death squads to drag you here. I'm assuming Mako has sent you here, assuring you wouldn't be harmed or something to that effect. Well that's not how things work. You broke the patron truce on Mako's behalf when you invaded Ghost Widow's vaults. It's well within the Arbiter's special powers to pass a death sentence on you. But that's not how we're going to play this game.<br><br>Mako has been out of control, flippantly disregarding the patron truce when it serves his purposes, then sending one of his lackeys to sacrifice in appeasement of the Arbiters. It's time for you to serve the greater glory of Arachnos, {VillainName}. If you do so, you might prove yourself a peer to Mako instead of a lackey.<br><br>I'll be short and to the point. we want you to play along and Mako's plans, and when he turns on you - and I DO mean WHEN - you will take him down and deliver him to us for punishment. You don't really have much choice in the matter, {VillainName}. It's the only way you can hope to survive Mako's 'tutelage' and stay in the good graces of Arachnos.<br><br>Go now, {VillainName}. We'll be waiting and watching."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1271139270" "You're back, {VillainName}? Huh, Arbiter Daos must be getting soft. I half-expected him to throw you in the brig to cool for awhile. Whatever. If you're still around, you're still useful. And I still want to use you to steal the power of the Leviathan!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P264697217" "It's time, {VillainName}! My Mu Mystics managed to decipher the Ritual of Z'kron, and translated it for you. The first part describes how to find the Cave of the Shaper. Within the cave there are these Fonts of Power which need to be destroyed; otherwise the Essence of the Leviathan will never be released. Then you need to find a chamber called the Maw of the Leviathan. It's guarded by a crazy old priest called Calystix who supposedly is very dangerous. The Mu Mystics have prepared a charm which will allow you to see the secret energies which flow throughout the temple, as well as the Primal Runes on a tooth which are normally hidden from sight.  When you enact the Ritual of Z'kron on the Primal Runes, the primal essence of the Leviathan will be transferred to me! You think you can handle it, {VillainName}? Now is NOT the time to disappoint me. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Find the Cave of the Shaper and steal the primal essence of the Leviathan for me!</A><br><br>You'd better make sure you take a high-powered team with you, 'cause I hear that priest is crazy-powerful!"
// AcceptString :
"P3523423590" "Steal primal essence of the Leviathan"
// SendOffString :
"P1754225455" "Don't worry, {VillainName} - I got a special reward for you once you finish this little task for me."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P498697122" "What you waitin' for, you little punk? I WANT THE POWER OF THE LEVIATHAN! NOW!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
